  "description": "Reborn as a villainess in a romance novel, Eudis Peregrine knows she’s destined to die at the hands of the tyrannical Emperor Theodore Waldemar. To avoid this cruel death, Eudis plans to stay far away. But after a drunken night at a masked ball, she wakes up in bed with none other than the emperor himself! Now, with the smitten Theodore proposing marriage, Eudis must navigate this unexpected plot twist. Can one night of romance change her predetermined fate, or is she bound to her tragic ending?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
